{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57029","headline":"风流箭语 · 佚名","name":"风流箭语","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风流箭，风流人人愿。\n（见《说郛》卷六一引《清异录》）（〖1〗《清异录》：「宝历中，帝造纸箭，竹皮弓纸间密贮龙麝末香。\n每宫嫔羣聚，帝躬射之，中者浓香，触体了无痛楚，名风流箭。\n爲之语曰〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}